this time with the help of a unicorn horn. I descended rapidly, there were
only 2 general stores so not much of a market for my gems, but enough to get
my first protection. I did find a GoP in a store a couple of levels below
Sokoban. I decided I wanted frostbrand as I don't like cleaver much, and not
only was Crom being stingy with artifacts, he gave me firebrand. Oh well
good enough for now. Descended rapidly, found the quest but did not enter.
Wanted to check out the medusa level first and see what was available. About
4 levels above the castle was a throne room. Cleared it with one retreat.
Funny enough it had a Grey dragon in it, but it didn't drop scales. Wen't up
to the throne. I sat 5 times. I got 2 wishes. My first was easy, I decided
to go for speed boots. Good. Kept sitting waiting to get shocked. Then the
second wish popped. I sat and thought a long time. I couldn't decide what I
needed, so finaly I decided that I would like a T-shirt. Wished for +2 but
it came out unenchanted. Oh well. Moving on, I reached medusa, and
remembered that I didn't have a form of levitation. Crap, oh well dropped
down the stairs anyways and did a quick recon. There's medusa over there at
the far end, I don't remember this layout. Also noted an Angle and the ever
present Titan. Is this guy gaurenteed to be here? Returned to identify rings
and see what was up. Wen't back to my level 2 altar. Ided my rings and found
that while I did not have levitation, I did have Polymorph and poly control.
Great I can transform into a flying creature and that will take care of my
problems. I couldn't remember if Vampire lords could fly and I needed holy
water, so I did a little test. Pick axed a near by fountain and turned into
